{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 90","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Proof_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Proof 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_90&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> positive reals, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e795553bf6d08b07bd4ad150611dad16679a4fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2+ab}+\\dfrac{b^2+c^2}{a^2+bc}+\\dfrac{c^2+a^2}{b^2+ca}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\" />. Find the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2ab0e818fe430bcaefae9b214aa2c17e194d3b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 2008N\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_90&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trivial_Inequality\" title=\"Trivial Inequality\">Trivial Inequality</a> (with equality happening if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/397fd7b1f33bdbf6ee27a83d1bcee42d222cb331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />),\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f95044995ee31e3ff3a34415643386dde4e8e9e7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^2 - 2ab + b^2 &amp;\\ge 0 \\\\ a^2 + b^2 &amp;\\ge 2ab. \\end{align*}\" width=\"157\" height=\"45\" />\nAdd <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c9eb71116fbc4a94b3cfd2ac07280d5a567f97e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c^2$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> to both sides and use the reciprocal property to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/d/dbd4ecb7fb2f0e2ca23799fd5006b32c405ae20f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^2 + b^2 + 2c^2 &amp;\\ge 2ab + 2c^2 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2ab+2c^2} &amp;\\ge \\frac{1}{a^2 + b^2 + 2c^2}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"233\" height=\"65\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff1e2f0661ebdf8c3a9aa1a284e80014ea38104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a^2 + 2b^2 \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />, multiplying both sides by this value would not change the inequality sign, and doing so results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/6/356cd62455d18262b2f36ba2208be31384b09b27.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{a^2+b^2}{ab+c^2} &amp;\\ge \\frac{2a^2 + 2b^2}{a^2+b^2+2c^2} \\\\ &amp;\\ge 2 \\left( \\frac{a^2+b^2}{a^2+c^2+b^2+c^2} \\right). \\end{align*}\" width=\"259\" height=\"90\" />\nBy using similar steps, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/2864dd2f53fcae901a4a392793720191ee349ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N \\ge 2 \\left( \\frac{a^2+b^2}{a^2+c^2+b^2+c^2} + \\frac{b^2+c^2}{b^2+a^2+c^2+a^2} + \\frac{a^2+c^2}{a^2+b^2+c^2+b^2}\\right).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"532\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d74e776b037a482afe3f2c12b9326cf9b22dcbf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a^2+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/0/c505f7f6461ebdee90674fc2290dc42f3d2168ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = b^2+c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da7d73fca393ca7fa5fe329e7199ee66bb26d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = a^2+c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />, making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e8ba80e8dce95040c2aa27d1b5ed9888e8a736a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N \\ge 2\\left(\\frac{x}{y+z} + \\frac{y}{x+z} + \\frac{z}{x+y}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"257\" height=\"43\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/4/29458e32fca739302f2306e7f3e319dcbfde29bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y+z} + \\frac{y}{x+z} + \\frac{z}{x+y} = (x+y+z)(\\frac{1}{y+z} + \\frac{1}{x+z} + \\frac{1}{x+y}) - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"520\" height=\"40\" />. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cauchy-Schwarz_Inequality\" title=\"Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality\">Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/f/96fb21a78c21866b9079804ff9f1b3260406e170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y+z+x+z+x+y)(\\frac{1}{y+z} + \\frac{1}{x+z} + \\frac{1}{x+y}) \\ge 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"412\" height=\"40\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/5/a15beb487b3b1d178fdf8353d663671c189b6671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y+z} + \\frac{y}{x+z} + \\frac{z}{x+y} \\ge \\frac32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"221\" height=\"42\" />. Equality happens if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc38e798917a1ef560a8feaef3dee1372cfad356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y+z)^2 = (x+z)^2 = (x+y)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"237\" height=\"19\" />, which is possible if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a9b0046a7446d1f3047baf2c28fd25355f57ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"11\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a9b0046a7446d1f3047baf2c28fd25355f57ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"11\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec0ce3f851e9d124ca3388a8bbdebb383a00f9dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b = c$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nTherefore, the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> (which happens if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec0ce3f851e9d124ca3388a8bbdebb383a00f9dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b = c$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98be716579d3a981d3092575f52aeebcc09da7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot \\frac32 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"68\" height=\"37\" />, so the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2ab0e818fe430bcaefae9b214aa2c17e194d3b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 2008N\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3df8b9defec953a9cf6dd8df288bb8fb0d7fcffa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6024}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Proof_2\">Proof 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_90&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Proof 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By AM-GM:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f1869df91dfbbb4758c69419e8bd72bec9930f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+b^2 \\geq 2ab\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore it suffices to prove\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44d03b63698af2d19b751268fdfd284c43001f88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N \\geq \\sum_{cyc} \\frac{2ab}{c^2+ab}\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>The equations are homogenous as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a constant and each term cancels to degree 0. Hence WLOG we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e32cfd3a6f5f31f73d0b272a5f7b1638fd16551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/73473e688d22f63789bfd893d7adb02cedce2f4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N \\geq \\sum_{cyc} \\frac{2abc}{c^3 + 1} \\iff \\sum_{cyc} \\frac{2}{c^3+1}\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c87af1048a20fb4c26e577b3f66c8cfd2f631569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> and define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9dd1fe4590b39259c898e9d691785862c2ce836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> analogously with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f51d57011f1c7cc6b8e9035808e3936ce524817.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> respectively. It follows that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/b/24b25ce4bc0f037b9f48bb07e7352b17a746ce5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N \\geq \\sum_{cyc} \\frac{2z^3}{z^3+1}\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"49\" />. \n</p><p>We may expand and notice that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed08b64d9d6e661d2a1fff51743133837bd4257.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N(x^3+1)(y^3+1)(z^3+1) \\geq \\sum_{cyc} 2z^2(x^3+1)(y^3+1)\\]\" width=\"407\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/336045eed0d0a38acc71a1139bfd830a150ee55b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N\\left(2+\\sum_{cyc}x^3+\\sum_{cyc}x^3y^3\\right)\\ge2\\sum_{cyc}x^3+4\\sum_{cyc}x^3y^3+6.\\]\" width=\"426\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62cbee4f6fd50f986cc39275a4e09aff1d2200a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=3$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> to remove 6. Then, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/3/b4356d313634929108df8ce1f83a8275cc95ab90.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} x^3 + \\sum_{cyc} x^3y^3 \\geq 0\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>must be true, which is factual. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62cbee4f6fd50f986cc39275a4e09aff1d2200a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=3$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> is the smallest value. It occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/566b9136144a62fac113ecbc8065793a74123238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> in the original inequality.\n</p><p>Hence the requested value is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca7bf86433971e9daea783ce881f590e3d03adc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2008)(3) = \\boxed{6024} \\quad \\square$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"178\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_90&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_89\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 89\">Problem 89</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_91\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 91\">Problem 91</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/